  <h1>Real Estate Investment</h1>

  <p>Our clients trust us to provide them with sound financial advice concerning real estate investment property in Middle Tennessee.</p>

  <p>No one can guarantee whether the market will go up or down, but after 60 years of tracking the local market, we at Midgett &amp; Fite have the skills to help you find the best values. Unlike stocks and bonds, real estate will always have value, God is not making any more of it, and as the saying goes&hellip;</p>
  <blockquote>&ldquo;The best investment on earth is earth.&rdquo; &mdash; Louis Glickman</blockquote>

  <p>Current market prices underscore the need to have an expert on your side. Whether you need a location for your business or are a first-time home buyer, Midgett &amp; Fite can help you find the best value for your needs. Check out our <a href="/brokerage-service">Brokerage Services</a> page for more details.</p>

  <blockquote>&ldquo;Real estate investing, even on a very small scale, remains a tried and true means of building an individual's cash flow and wealth.&rdquo; &mdash; Robert Kiyosaki</blockquote>

  <p>We can show you how investing in real estate can help you round out your portfolio. Most investors make the mistake of only purchasing stocks and bonds when they invest. However, a polling of major trust managers shows that having a proper balance of assets including real estate is the key to long-term growth. At Midgett &amp; Fite, we understand why this is true!</p>

  <p>Dan Midgett has the tools to evaluate and compare an investment in real estate with your other portfolio asset classes. His market experience and education earned him the designation of CCIM, Certified Commercial Investment Member. At present, Dan is the only CCIM in Lebanon. His analytical mind and proven sales record make him a natural for investing, and he has the patience to accurately teach his clients, passing on his knowledge to help them make sound investment decisions. Let Dan be your source for real estate investment.</p>

  <blockquote>&ldquo;Landlords grow rich in their sleep.&rdquo; &mdash; John Stuart Mill</blockquote>

  <p>Whereas other firms might only sell you investment property, at Midgett &amp; Fite we offer tailored service to help you manage your investment. Over combined decades of experience, Dan Midgett and Dewey Fite have provided clients with Property Management services. We can eliminate the conflicts of interest you may have experienced at other firms. Whether you want to manage your investment property yourself, or entrust that task to us, we want to help you succeed. Check out our <a href="/property-management">Property Management</a> page for more details.</p>

  <p>In addition to our management services and listing/selling real estate, we are also available for consultation when you decide to venture into finding investment property in Middle Tennessee. Call us today and set up your risk-free appointment.</p>

